  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Certification service for Kalappai (\u0b95\u0bb2\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc8) typing tutor \u2014 W3C Verifiable Credentials (VC-JWT, EdDSA) + Open Badges 3.0-shaped achievement, QR verify pages, HMAC tamper-evidence",
